    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>过年整了个M1 的mac mini，就开始倒腾了，一直想知道能不能编译kernel，在公司的环境下交叉编译ebpf失败了，所以想在m1上用qemu试一下，</p><p>在用qemu装arm发行版的ubuntu参考了下面两个帖子</p><p><a href="https://gist.github.com/niw/e4313b9c14e968764a52375da41b4278">https://gist.github.com/niw/e4313b9c14e968764a52375da41b4278</a></p><p><a href="https://jia.je/software/2021/01/02/aarch64-debian-in-qemu-m1/">https://jia.je/software/2021/01/02/aarch64-debian-in-qemu-m1/</a></p><p>其实按照第一个链接基本就可以操作了，主要mark一下其中遇到的问题</p><p>1.<a href="https://git.qemu.org/git/qemu.git">https://git.qemu.org/git/qemu.git</a> clone慢的问题，推荐使用<a href="https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/qemu.git">https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/qemu.git</a> 替换，</p><p>中间是下载了gitee的代码，不是最新代码，打不patch</p><p>2.切换分支的时候不能到最新，需要切换到指定节点</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git checkout d0dddab40e -b wip/hvf</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>3.执行下面命令是文件路径最好为绝对路径</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">./qemu-system-aarch64 \</span><br><span class="line">  -monitor stdio \</span><br><span class="line">  -M virt,highmem=off \</span><br><span class="line">  -accel hvf \</span><br><span class="line">  -cpu cortex-a72 \</span><br><span class="line">  -smp 4 \</span><br><span class="line">  -m 4096 \</span><br><span class="line">  -drive file=~/Downloads/pflash0.img,format=raw,if=pflash,readonly=on \</span><br><span class="line">  -drive file=~/Downloads/pflash1.img,format=raw,if=pflash \</span><br><span class="line">  -device virtio-gpu-pci \</span><br><span class="line">  -display default,show-cursor=on \</span><br><span class="line">  -device qemu-xhci \</span><br><span class="line">  -device usb-kbd \</span><br><span class="line">  -device usb-tablet \</span><br><span class="line">  -device intel-hda \</span><br><span class="line">  -device hda-duplex \</span><br><span class="line">  -drive file=~/Downloads/ubuntu.qcow2,if=virtio,cache=writethrough \</span><br><span class="line">  -cdrom ~/Downloads/ubuntu-20.04.1-live-server-arm64.iso</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>搞完了，下面看看ebpf能不能调起来。</p>]]>
    </content>
