    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>倒腾了一天的hexo，遇到一个坑，网上搜来搜去找不到，在hexo deploy之后没反应</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">D:\blog&gt; hexo deploy -g</span><br><span class="line">INFO  Validating config</span><br><span class="line">INFO  Start processing</span><br><span class="line">INFO  Files loaded in 113 ms</span><br><span class="line">INFO  0 files generated in 30 ms</span><br><span class="line">INFO  Deploying: git</span><br><span class="line">INFO  Clearing .deploy_git folder...</span><br><span class="line">INFO  Copying files from public folder...</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>网上找了很久试了各种配置都不行，最后实在是不行只能在安装hexo目录下搜索“Copying files from public folder…”，找到node_modules\hexo-deployer-git\lib\deployer.js，在代码中添加打印发现是 fs.copyDir(publicDir, deployDir, opts);没有返回，直接修改代码如下</p><figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (<span class="keyword">typeof</span> ignorePattern === <span class="string">&#x27;string&#x27;</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  opts.<span class="property">ignorePattern</span> = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">RegExp</span>(ignorePattern);</span><br><span class="line">&#125; <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="keyword">if</span> (<span class="keyword">typeof</span> ignorePattern === <span class="string">&#x27;object&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; <span class="title class_">Reflect</span>.<span class="title function_">apply</span>(<span class="title class_">Object</span>.<span class="property"><span class="keyword">prototype</span></span>.<span class="property">hasOwnProperty</span>, ignorePattern, [<span class="string">&#x27;public&#x27;</span>])) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  opts.<span class="property">ignorePattern</span> = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">RegExp</span>(ignorePattern.<span class="property">public</span>);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">   fs.<span class="title function_">copyDir</span>(publicDir, deployDir, opts);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">return</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>done.</p>]]>
    </content>
